[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0399","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0399.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0724","title":"Microsoft Windows SMB 网络共享提供程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT/2000/XP 的 SMB（服务器消息块）协议实现中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 SMB_COM_TRANSACTION 数据包，请求 NetShareEnum、NetServerEnum2 或 NetServerEnum3 服务，触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致系统崩溃或拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 7.5，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用，影响 Windows NT 4.0、Windows 2000 及 Windows XP 等版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0724"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:00Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-045 对应的补丁程序。对于 Windows NT 4.0/2000/XP，可通过 Windows Update 获取更新。由于这些系统已停止支持，建议升级到受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11）；若无法升级，在防火墙和路由器上阻止 TCP 端口 139 和 445 以阻断外部 SMB 流量，并限制局域网内对共享资源的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103011556323184&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/250635","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/311619","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/342243","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-045","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A189","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21747","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0724.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0724","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0724.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0724.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0724.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0724.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0724.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2002/CVE-2002-0724.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0724.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-0724.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0399.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0397","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0397.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0723","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 同源策略绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 和 6.0 版本在处理浏览器窗口中的框架时未能正确验证其所属域，导致同源策略被绕过。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，利用 OBJECT 标签跨域读取客户端本地文件或调用可执行对象，造成敏感信息泄露或任意代码执行。攻击者只需诱导用户访问特制页面即可触发，无需任何身份认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0723"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 6.0 Service Pack 1 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续更新中修复。如无法升级，建议禁用 ActiveX 控件和脚本的跨域访问权限，或将 Internet 区域安全级别设置为「高」以阻止跨框架脚本执行。长期缓解措施建议迁移至现代浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge、Chrome、Firefox），因 IE 已停止安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9537.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5196","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-047","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21606","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0723.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0723.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0723","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0723.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0723.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2002/CVE-2002-0723.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0723.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0723.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0723.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0723.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0397.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0397.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0397.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0368","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0368.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0648","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer XML 数据岛重定向文件泄漏漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.01/5.5/6.0 的 XML 数据岛（data-island）功能中存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造一个包含恶意 `src` 属性的 HTML 页面，利用 `<script>` 标签的 XML 数据岛能力将 URL 重定向到本地文件，从而读取目标系统上的任意 XML 文件及其他类型文件的部分内容。攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户访问恶意网页即可触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。该漏洞影响 IE 5.01/5.5/6.0 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0648"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:51Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-047 提供的 Internet Explorer 累积补丁（KB323759），将 IE 升级至 5.01 Service Pack 3、5.5 Service Pack 2 或 6.0 最新累积更新版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在 IE 安全设置中将「对标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件执行脚本」设为禁用，或使用组策略限制 XML data-island 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","refe