VE-2002-0368.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0368.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0368.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0366","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0366.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0647","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 遗留文本格式ActiveX控件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.01、5.5 及 6.0 版本中存在一个用于显示特殊格式文本的遗留 ActiveX 控件缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制网页，诱使用户访问后触发该 ActiveX 控件缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。微软尚未发布官方补丁，建议用户禁用相关 ActiveX 控件或升级浏览器版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0647"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:51Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-047 提供的累积补丁 Q323759，该补丁为受影响 ActiveX 控件设置 kill bit 以彻底禁用其执行。IE 5.01 用户需运行于 Windows 2000 SP2/SP3 环境，IE 5.5 用户需安装 SP1 或 SP2 后打补丁，IE 6.0 用户直接安装。安装后重启系统，并通过 IE 帮助菜单确认更新版本号包含 Q323759。如无法安装补丁，可将 Internet 区域 ActiveX 控件和插件设置为禁用，并将 Outlook 邮件阅读区域设为受限站点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9935.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5558","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-047","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21748","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0647.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0647","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0647.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0647.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0647.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71d64a6d3b3901a67b0e17d4598d8a385b75e78d/2002/CVE-2002-0647.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0647.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0647.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0647.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0647.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0366.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0366.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0366.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0290","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0290.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1126","title":"Mozilla 浏览器 OnUnload 事件处理程序远程信息泄露漏洞","description":"Mozilla 1.1 及更早版本及其衍生浏览器（如 Netscape 和 Galeon）在加载新页面时，对文档 Referrer 字段的更新机制存在缺陷。当页面跳转时，浏览器会在 `onunload` 事件处理程序执行完毕前过早地设置 Referrer，使得恶意网页可以通过监听 `onunload` 事件，在用户离开当前页时获取其即将访问的下一个 URL 路径（包括用户手动输入的隐私地址）。攻击者只需诱导用户访问一个含有恶意脚本的网页，即可在用户跳转至其他页面时窃取其浏览轨迹，导致用户隐私信息泄露。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1126"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:46Z","remediation":"建议将 Mozilla 浏览器及其衍生版本（如 Netscape, Galeon）升级至 1.2 或更高版本。对于无法升级的旧版环境，建议在浏览器设置中禁用 Referrer 发送，或安装现代的安全浏览器以替代旧版 Mozilla 浏览器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=145579","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103176760004720&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10084.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:075","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-192.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-046.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5694","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1126.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1126","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1126.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7bea0dcb5dee2f48877390a7bd4e855e990c4f7a/2002/CVE-2002-1126.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1126.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/de5e978a48281a824409de119a9380c20aa11e39/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1126.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1126.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1126.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1126.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-11xx/CVE-2002-1126.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0285","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0285.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0989","title":"Gaim 聊天客户端 URL 处理任意脚本执行漏洞","description":"Gaim 0.59.1 之前的版本在帮助文档浏览器的 URL 处理机制中存在输入验证缺陷，未能有效过滤 shell 元字符。远程攻击者可通过构建包含恶意 shell 元字符的特制链接，诱导用户点击，从而在受害者系统中执行任意脚本或命令。该漏洞影响所有安装了受影响版本 Gaim 的客户端，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过社交工程手段触发，可导致受害主机的系统权限被非法获取或执行恶意指令。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0989"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:31Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Gaim 客户端升级至 0.59.1 或更高版本，以修复 URL 处理程序中对 shell 元字符过滤不严导致的