","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0970","title":"KDE Konqueror SSL 证书验证绕过漏洞","description":"KDE 3.0.2 及更早版本中的 Konqueror 浏览器在 SSL 实现上存在严重安全缺陷，未能正确验证由中间 CA 签发证书的基本约束（Basic Constraints）字段。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，即可在网络通信路径中实施中间人攻击，伪造受信任站点的 SSL 证书，使用户误认为正在与合法网站建立安全加密连接，从而窃听或篡改用户在受保护会话中传输的敏感数据。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0970"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:29Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0170.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000519","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102918241005893&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-155","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20020818-1.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:058","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-221.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5410","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9776","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2002/CVE-2002-0970.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2009/CVE-2009-0653.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0970.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0970.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0970","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0970.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0970.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/891288105232b