m/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/315d6d428c9813126fac0eadf43ea4f31aa35f4e/2002/CVE-2002-0972.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0972.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a8ab7e50610a40270e5e9a2820bdbd3f2f8bafbc/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0972.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/04ded07645d3d1d1ff4bc7fdbd85d7a922796dcd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0972.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0972.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0972.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0280.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0456","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0456.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0874","title":"RedHat Interchange 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"RedHat Interchange 4.8.6、4.8.3 及之前版本在 INET 模式下存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，通过向目标服务器发送特制请求，读取系统上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响范围较广，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可触发，危害等级中等。目前官方已发布安全更新建议升级至最新版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0874"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Interchange 至 4.8.7 或更高版本（Debian 系统参照 DSA-150 安全公告更新软件包）。如无法升级，将运行模式从 INET 切换为 UNIX 域套接字模式，并在反向代理层配置规则拦截包含 `../` 的 URL 请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-150","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21706","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0874.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0874.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0874","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0874.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0874.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/eaba6ba6891dae2972376e68ae56a38b641030d7/2002/CVE-2002-0874.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0874.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0874.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0874.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0874.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0456.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0454","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0454.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0859","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 Jet 引擎 OpenDataSource 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 的 Jet 引擎 OpenDataSource 函数存在 Unicode 缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标数据库服务器发送特制的 Unicode 字符串参数触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而在系统上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SQL Server 2000 及 Microsoft Jet 4.0 数据库引擎，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0859"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:16Z","remediation":"安装微软安全公告 MS02-035 提供的 Jet 4.0 数据库引擎更新（KB Q282010），该补丁修复了 OpenDataSource 函数中的 Unicode 缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 Microsoft SQL Server 2000 和 Jet 4.0 均已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的 SQL Server 版本（如 2019/2022）。临时缓解措施：在网络防火墙限制对 SQL Server 1433 端口的访问，仅允许受信任主机连接；在 SQL Server 中禁用 OPENROWSET 和 OpenDataSource 函数，或撤销 PUBLIC 角色对临时分布式查询的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102450188620081&w=2","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ282010","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9375.php","http://www.nextgenss.com/advisories/mssql-ods.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5057","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21569","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0859.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0859.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0859.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0859.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0859","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0859.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0859.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0859.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0859.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/106a1fdac91d72807fea971dfa93d601744b9ae9/2002/CVE-2002-0859.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0454.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0453","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0453.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0851","title":"ISDN4Linux IPPPD 格式字符串本地权限提升漏洞","description":"ISDN4Linux (i4l) 套件中的 ISDN 点对点协议守护进程 (ipppd) 存在格式化字符串漏洞。当本地用户通过命令行参数传递设备名称时，该参数中的格式化字符串未被正确过滤即传入 syslog 函数，导致攻击者可利用 %n 等格式化符号实现任意内存写入。本地攻击者只需拥有系统普通用户权限，即可通过向 ipppd 传递特制的设备名字符串触发该漏洞，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 ISDN4Linux 3.1 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0851"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:15Z","remediation":"升级 ISDN4Linux 软件包 isdnutils 至 1:3.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了 ipppd 守护进程在处理设备名参数时未正确过滤格式化字符串的问题。如无法升级，可通过移除 ipppd 的 setuid 权限或限制本地用户对 ISDN 设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0068.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9811.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5437","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21701","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0851.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0851.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0851","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0851.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0851.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5ed23ad1e6e5869267a4c8091cffdf6711227b5/2002/CVE-2002-0851.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0851.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0851.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0851.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0851.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-